          "Cambridge Research Station was created to provide a stimulating research and development environment in zero-g and to enable us to study the Organisms from the Edge Nebula. These opportunities were unavailable on our planetside locations due to the Alien Import Prohibition Act of 500 AS, which prohibits the importing of any Alien Organism onto inhabited planets.",
