        "category": "Ballenshine Pronounced Dead",
        "headline": "Ballenshine Pronounced Dead",
        "text": "Liberty Secretary James Ballenshine collapsed today and was evacuated to a government medical unit, where he was pronounced dead of natural causes. President Jacobi said that his sudden passing will not diminish Liberty's commitment to peace and stability in the colonies. She will now be attending the summit meeting on Curacao in his place."
