          "As much as Xenos hate Junkers, we aren’t strong enough to get rid of those scavengers. They run the shipping points for inbound drug shipments into Liberty. First we gotta push the Junkers out of Texas, and then we need to find a way to kick the Junkers out of Liberty. Once that’s done, no one will be able to stop the Xenos. We'll control the Cardamine that enters Liberty space, and those rich elites that run the show in Manhattan will be at our mercy.",
          "Hudson is perfect for our operations in this sector. The Jump Hole to Bering and our supply point at Freeport 2 is in the Wrangell Field -- where you’ll find plenty of Rogues, though they don’t bother us too much. The Texas Jump Hole is in the Sitka Field. It's our portal for conducting business in Texas -- liberating our comrades from Huntsville, and hitting the Junkers and Outcasts.",
