        "text": "Elsewhere in the colonies, news of the Liberty President’s political troubles has been utterly suppressed by the \"iron fist of the Liberty media machine.\" We are grateful to the Chancellor and the Ministry of Truth for their tireless commitment to the freedom of information that we enjoy here in Rheinland."
